# An UNPACKED APK — classes.dex, META-INF, decompiled bytecode. Reference material someone handed
# over, not source, and 9.7 MB of it. The archive it came from is what belongs in a repo, if
# anything does.
# An UNPACKED APK. 9.7 MB of classes.dex, META-INF and decompiled bytecode is not source
# and is ignored — but `assets/public/` is. That is the hand-built UI the factory already
# has and likes: ~30 screens, shared.css, the Material green palette, the mushroom mark.
# It is the visual reference this product is being built toward.
#
# Git cannot re-include a file whose PARENT DIRECTORY is excluded, so the exclusion steps
# down one level at a time rather than ignoring the whole tree and negating inside it.
MushroomOS-extracted/*
!MushroomOS-extracted/assets/
MushroomOS-extracted/assets/*
!MushroomOS-extracted/assets/public/
apk_extracted/

# OX Alpha isolated working copy of mushroomos/ — sandbox only, canonical work stays in mushroomos/.
mushroomos-alpha/

# ── Not source ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# A 495 MB working copy and a 201 MB zip of it. Whatever is worth keeping in
# there belongs in the tree itself, not as a second checkout inside the first.
mushroomos-codex/
*.zip

